[I] mro::* interface compatibility for Perls < 5.9.5

[T] MRO::Compat provides the mro:: method resolution order interface of Perl
[T] 5.9.5 and later, such as mro::get_linear_isa, also on older Perls.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/MRO-Compat

